{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a2c3c28d5aa3adaf","name":"Land Mine","source":{"id":"source:reference-a2c3c28d5aa3adaf","title":"Land Mine","revision":19509,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:06:07Z","sha256":"8f7fb746f3cd00c41a23a254b8957b1349d4e6cdd4a0ce96388d300122969126","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19509","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Land%20Mine&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a2c3c28d5aa3adaf","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Mines, unlike traditional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Explosives"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Explosives"},", are designed to be placed in the ground or otherwise hidden from sight. Anyone attempting to notice a Mine takes a -5 penalty on his or her ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check. Setting a Mine is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"}," that does not require a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check. However, attaching a detonator (either a Timer or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Manual Trigger"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Manual_Trigger","referenceId":"reference:3bac33a88449a688"},") requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check as usual, and supersedes the Mine's normal triggering system.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The standard Land Mine is an antipersonnel device that uses pressure sensors to determine when a target moves over it. A Land Mine is placed on the ground (in any square adjacent to you) and is triggered when any character, creature, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," enters the square in which it is placed. A Land Mine damages everything in a 1-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Tiny\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 8d6 (Energy)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Radius:"]}," 1-Square (",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"},")\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
